      <p>At <strong>ToolsBuilt</strong> (accessible from https://toolsbuilt.com), one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document details the types of information collected and recorded by ToolsBuilt and how we use it.</p>

      <h2>Client-Side Tool Processing</h2>
      <p>ToolsBuilt is designed as a client-side utility suite. When you enter dates, numbers, or parameters into our calculators (such as the Days Until Date Calculator), all computations take place locally within your web browser. <strong>We do not transmit, collect, store, or share your calculator inputs on any server.</strong></p>

      <h2>Log Files</h2>
      <p>ToolsBuilt follows a standard procedure of using log files. These files log visitors when they visit websites. Web hosting companies log standard data such as internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date and time stamp, referring/exit pages, and number of clicks. This information is not linked to any personally identifiable information and is used exclusively for analyzing web performance, administering the site, and securing infrastructure.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
      <p>Like any other website, ToolsBuilt uses basic cookies and local browser storage. We use your browser's local storage on your own device to remember your preferences, such as your theme (Light or Dark mode), the tools you recently visited and, for some tools, your last-used inputs. This data is never sent to our servers. Passwords generated by the Password Generator and names entered into the Random Name Picker are never stored. You can clear this data at any time in your browser settings.</p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>We use Google Analytics to understand how ToolsBuilt is used, such as which pages are viewed, the type of device and browser, and approximate location. Google Analytics may set cookies or use similar technologies. If your browser sends a "Do Not Track" signal, we do not load Google Analytics. You can also opt out with the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.</p>

      <h2>Your Tool Inputs</h2>
      <p>Values you enter into our calculators and tools are processed in your browser and are not sent to our servers.</p>

      <h2>Google AdSense &amp; Third-Party Advertising</h2>
      <p>We may display third-party advertisements served by Google AdSense and its partner advertising networks on ToolsBuilt to support our free operations.</p>

      <ul>
        <li>Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to ToolsBuilt or other websites on the internet.</li>
        <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visit to ToolsBuilt and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
        <li>Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>. Alternatively, you can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.aboutads.info</a>.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Third Party Privacy Policies</h2>
      <p>ToolsBuilt's Privacy Policy does not apply to other advertisers or third-party websites. Thus, we advise you to consult the respective Privacy Policies of these third-party ad servers for more detailed information. It may include their practices and instructions about how to opt-out of certain options.</p>

      <p>You can choose to disable cookies through your individual browser options. Detailed information about cookie management with specific web browsers can be found at the browsers' respective websites.</p>

      <h2>CCPA Privacy Rights (Do Not Sell My Personal Information)</h2>
      <p>Under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), California consumers have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Request that a business that collects a consumer's personal data disclose the categories and specific pieces of personal data collected.</li>
        <li>Request that a business delete any personal data about the consumer that a business has collected.</li>
        <li>Request that a business that sells a consumer's personal data, not sell the consumer's personal data.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>ToolsBuilt does not sell personal data. If you make a request regarding your rights, we have one month to respond to you. If you would like to exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:abuumair2025@gmail.com">abuumair2025@gmail.com</a>.</p>

      <h2>GDPR Data Protection Rights</h2>
      <p>We want to ensure you are fully aware of all of your data protection rights under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR). Every user is entitled to the following:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>The right to access:</strong> You have the right to request copies of your personal data.</li>
        <li><strong>The right to rectification:</strong> You have the right to request that we correct any information you believe is inaccurate.</li>
        <li><strong>The right to erasure:</strong> You have the right to request that we erase your personal data, under certain conditions.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Children's Information</h2>
      <p>Another part of our priority is adding protection for children while using the internet. We encourage parents and guardians to observe, participate in, and/or monitor and guide their online activity. ToolsBuilt does not knowingly collect any Personal Identifiable Information from children under the age of 13.</p>

      <h2>Consent</h2>
      <p>By using our website, you hereby consent to our Privacy Policy and agree to its terms.</p>
